7a30f&oh=00_AfyXKxZrQioUpiTI_0E97Loh7b5sFIh_Q7LS6ZQEuW58gg&oe=69D111D5"}, {"file_name": "VR180-HOA-2560x1440.png", "id": "1083182463228571", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295272_1083182466561904_7722284336074449379_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=16eUW0gSHOgQ7kNvwEy_Tb_&_nc_oc=AdqNS2G-CI0HIIdAQAyoQo2oADivkmH-qKV90eGvo46EukhrzUUt0lX4Ck0cnz9kTZU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxUvleSfnUx6nwaUSPny-z29av1fxEyvWOhIWt7B-ukCw&oe=69D10572"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Twinkle Video Player", "keywords": ["NDI", "Ambisonics", "Spatial"], "long_description": "# The Pro Video Player for Universal Connectivity\n\nThis isn't just another streaming app \u2014 it's a portal that makes your PC feel truly native to VR. \n   * \u26a1 1-Frame Latency.\n   * \ud83c\udfaf Zero Mouse Lag.\n\nDo you like this screen-to-screen latency? \ud83d\ude09\n\n{1031169699219721}\n\n**\ud83d\ude80 The Most Powerful NDI Player**\n\nTwinkle's full-featured NDI capabilities unlock new possibilities for streaming on Meta Quest platform.\n{4327704144173412}\n\n**\ud83c\udfa7 Spatial Audio: Local files & NDI Streams**\n   * Ambisonics: FOA, SOA, HOA, Audio360.\n   * Automatic Stereo Spatialization.\n{756681966764437}\n\n\n **\u2728 First VR Player supports 3D LUTs**\n   * Load .cube files for instant film-grade stylization.\n   * Rapidly transform your videos with professional color looks.\n\n \n**\ud83c\udf1fFirst VR Player supports STMap**\n* Real-time fisheye unwrapping, no high-end PC required.\n* Direct camera footage processing for true WYSIWYG.\n\n# Support & Community Hub\n\nFind all resources and connect with us at:\n\nhttps://www.twinkle-vr.com\n\n- PC Streaming Setup Guides.\n- Troubleshooting & FAQs.\n- Submit Feature Requests.\n- Join Our Community.\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "The Professional Video Player for Universal Connectivity\nExperience the freedom of 